    <title>Vol.04 我们的圣诞节回忆：友情的铃铛叮叮当当🔔✨</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6766e3be1e823e72d3a94a30</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6766e3be1e823e72d3a94a30</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>❄️今年圣诞你所在的城市下雪了吗？</span><br><span>🎅准备好圣诞帽和热红酒了吗？</span><br><span>❤️一起听听我们的圣诞故事吧 </span><br><span>𝓜𝓮𝓻𝓻𝔂 𝓒𝓱𝓻𝓲𝓼𝓽𝓶𝓪𝓼 🎄•͈˽•͈🎄🎅🏻</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgTg6yDLT9mDqWsiwlLx4NZRCucF.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgad2ByiAucoW4VB7eAqwGtiUY55.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsnnfSXYbxY86gKXPIOOcPKYXKG9.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>「 Timeline 」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> </span><strong><span>我们为什么最喜欢圣诞节？</span></strong><span>❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> </span><strong><span>我们最讨厌的节日</span></strong><span>😠（春节、清明）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 希尔真：思念去世的亲人在日常的生活里也可以做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> </span><strong><span>我们的圣诞童年回忆🎄✨</span></strong><span>（铲铲篇：给班上同学怒写30张贺卡）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">13:47</a> （希尔真篇：妈妈陪我一起去英语班过圣诞）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a> </span><strong><span>第一次在家办「圣诞party」</span></strong><span>（铲铲：和小狗、朋友们一起搭圣诞树，啃鸡腿喝酒看小鬼当家 ps：安利多人聚会游戏——逛三园）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1486">24:46</a> （</span><strong><span>希尔真篇：和女人们在天台跳抖臀舞、在墙上画裸体、喝到断片 </span></strong><span>ps：安利多人聚会游戏——女性主义版你画我猜）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 铲铲第二次在家办圣诞party（给美国人一点culture shock🤏、和朋友们互送圣诞礼物 ps：安利一款桌游 以色列麻将）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a> 希尔真和朋友</span><strong><span>互送圣诞礼物</span></strong><span> 全是惊喜！！！ 大家都好用心❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">38:04</a> </span><strong><span>今年我们准备怎样过圣诞？</span></strong><span>🎅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">39:25</a> 铲铲今年圣诞在家过：搭圣诞树、煮热红酒、做圣诞拼贴海报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a> </span><strong><span>我们理想的圣诞节？</span></strong><span>（铲铲理想的圣诞节——去冰岛雷克雅未克）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 希尔真理想的圣诞节——像《老友记》那样</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「 节目中使用的音乐 」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=36871044" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=36871044"><span>クリスマスソング-back number</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=22064663" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=22064663"><span>It's Beginning to Look a Lot like Christmas-Michael Bublé</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=1000553" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=1000553"><span>When Christmas Comes To Town-Meagan Moore</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=1127655" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=1127655"><span>A Holly Jolly Christmas-Burl Ives</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=540931" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=540931"><span>Christmas Eve-山下達郎</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「 推荐作品 」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📺 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Zf4y117Bz/?spm_id_from=333.1387.upload.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=4791ae7d965fbeb8364a6a09eb716fc4" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Zf4y117Bz/?spm_id_from=333.1387.upload.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=4791ae7d965fbeb8364a6a09eb716fc4"><span>视频@亲爱的嘉倩（b站）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎬</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1306785/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1306785/"><span>电影《极地特快》2004</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎬</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/3632505/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/3632505/"><span>动画《马丁的早晨》2003</span></a></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>「 staff 」</span></strong></h3><span></span><p><span>🌟 本期主播｜@希尔真：base深圳，b站up主，给猫猫打工人。@铲铲chan：武汉，ui/视觉设计师/拍摄剪辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟 声音设计｜@铲铲chan</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟 封面设计｜@铲铲chan</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「 合作 」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱 1105299633@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢uu萌的收听，我们会不定期更新节目～欢迎大家来评论区多多互动，别忘记订阅我们的播客哦～❤️</span></p>]]></description>
