    <title>Vol.3 清迈夏日梦（下）：雨下再大又怎样？干脆开心淋一场🌧️</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d721c74a0f950f844a07f3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d721c74a0f950f844a07f3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播希尔真与主播铲铲对话：小镇女孩➕英语小白，人生第一次出国 ，是如何让自己开口交流的，以及经历了什么有趣的经历呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期博客，希尔真会分享在清迈旅居半个月的真实感受和有趣的经历，以及附上无比详细的出国游玩攻略与小技巧，快来收听吧👂</span></p><span></span><h3><br></h3><span></span><h2><span>「 Timeline 」</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 躲雨or淋雨？我们都要！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg8F-Fue9zzSqS1uQGTorKmE6m3R.jpg"></figure><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> 在路边的门洞里边看暴雨边吃香蕉饼—属于雨季去清迈的希尔真</span></h3><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> 对待动物表演，我们应该坚决抵制！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> 希尔真炫过6次的泰餐厅——</span><strong><span>Mr.Kai</span></strong><span>，到底有多好吃呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> </span><strong><span>在海外找好吃餐厅的方法</span></strong><span>🔍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> 一位可爱的云南阿姨开的咖啡厅☕️——</span><strong><span>Let it be</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqR-iUODZpwtRlE9MzpEr7yGdSLx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">27:29</a> 便宜又好次的北门市集宵夜摊子、水果市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2044">34:04</a> </span><strong><span>清迈北门爵士酒吧</span></strong><span>-是营销来的网红店还是真有实力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> i人冰冰在酒吧忘我的跳舞💃，惊呆e人希尔真</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3041">50:41</a> 希尔真在清迈冒犯他人和被他人冒犯的有趣经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3844">1:04:04</a> </span><strong><span>和陌生美洲女人的拥抱</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4188">1:09:48</a> 英语混子希尔真：“Can you help hot this?"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">1:17:00</a> 什么！Ghat GPT还可以免费学英语？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4920">1:22:00</a> 铲铲的</span><strong><span>学英语好方法分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5270">1:27:50</a> “</span><strong><span>女子监狱马杀鸡</span></strong><span>”听起来好酷！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5690">1:34:50</a> 喜欢vintage的有福了，超棒</span><strong><span>古着店的安利</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6068">1:41:08</a> 希尔真经典国人：来都来了，纹个</span><strong><span>纹身</span></strong><span>再回吧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGCkLRQXKinsoJ7h950iIxvn2or.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6660">1:51:00</a> </span><strong><span>清迈书店</span></strong><span>推荐~</span></p><span></span><h3><br></h3><span></span><h2><span>「 节目中使用的音乐 」</span></h2><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=2042008910" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=2042008910"><span>烟花-窦靖童</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=5057917" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=5057917"><span>Forrest Gump Suite-《阿甘正传》配乐</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=4336098" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=4336098"><span>Let it be-The Beatles</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=1328962918" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=1328962918"><span>Reality-Richard Sanderson</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=26110444" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=26110444"><span> CHA CHA CHA-一十三十一</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=28493451" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=28493451"><span>We Are The World-群星</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=1329105590" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=1329105590"><span>Dance with Me-beabadoobee</span></a></p><span></span><h3><br></h3><span></span><h2><span>「 推荐作品 」</span></h2><span></span><p><span>🎙️ </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6432afe666e4c00c6a9ea43a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6432afe666e4c00c6a9ea43a"><span>播客《假如有套套》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📖 </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/34913119/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/34913119/"><span>书籍 [韩]张同完/2019/北京日报出版社《我在100内自学英文翻转人生》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📺 </span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/95012810?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/95012810?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>b站——@小老虎的泰国行</span></a></p><span></span><h3><br></h3><span></span><h2><span>「 staff 」</span></h2><span></span><p><span>🌟 本期主播｜@希尔真：base深圳，b站up主，打工养猫人。@铲铲chan：武汉，ui/视觉设计师，自由职业中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟 声音设计｜@铲铲chan</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟 封面设计｜@铲铲chan</span></p><span></span><h2><span>「 合作 」</span></h2><span></span><p><span>微信:Cactuschan_</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱:lovechanfree@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢uu萌的收听，我们会不定期更新节目～欢迎大家来评论区多多互动，别忘记订阅我们的播客哦～❤️</span></p>]]></description>
