    <title>Vol.2 清迈夏日梦（上）：异国ta乡又怎样？反正我现在边看日出边吃柚子，香得嘞！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ce247056bfd3907a8ca7e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ce247056bfd3907a8ca7e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播希尔真与主播铲铲对话：小镇女孩➕英语小白，人生第一次出国 ，是如何让自己开口交流的，以及经历了什么有趣的经历呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期博客，希尔真会分享在清迈旅居半个月的真实感受和有趣的经历，以及附上无比详细的出国游玩攻略与小技巧，快来收听吧👂</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「 Timeline 」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第一部分：就算明天出发，也需要准备</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 出发的契机：只见过两面的女人们在群里一拍即合，</span><strong><span>说走就走</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 尽管说走就走，仍要货比三家，选择</span><strong><span>性价比</span></strong><span>最高的机票！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 持</span><strong><span>护照</span></strong><span>也可以在香港停留7天！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 在异国他乡和朋友相见，想想都好幸福！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 泰国机场工作人员说</span><strong><span>中文</span></strong><span>指路，震惊希尔真！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 希尔真在机场找地方睡觉，见到了传说中的嬉皮士。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 建议在</span><strong><span>出发前</span></strong><span>就买好</span><strong><span>泰国电话卡</span></strong><span>噢！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第二部分：初来泰国，受到的文化冲击</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> 什么？还有</span><strong><span>“死亡”博物馆！</span></strong><span>面对死亡，我们应该持有何种心态呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a></span><strong><span> 17元</span></strong><span>人民币一碗的</span><strong><span>海鲜粉</span></strong><span>太香了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> </span><strong><span>坐船</span></strong><span>居然是</span><strong><span>曼谷公共交通</span></strong><span>的方式之一！还可以看到日落！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsvVysCq6rEDf7NkBXggAPXP3bHq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a> 可以</span><strong><span>躺下睡觉的大巴车</span></strong><span>，坐它！又省一夜住宿费！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a> 人类</span><strong><span>生存</span></strong><span>与</span><strong><span>生活</span></strong><span>需要的物资是不一样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a> 被孟买市场的蟑螂吓的跳起来，路边的外国人：</span><strong><span>中国人，可爱！</span></strong><span>（到底谁是外国人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2825">47:05</a> 通过</span><strong><span>facebook</span></strong><span>也可以租房，参加</span><strong><span>小组活动</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2916">48:36</a> 在</span><strong><span>Free Bird Coffee</span></strong><span>和太平洋对岸的蓝眼睛女孩发生了一段超越时空的对话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmXgm1iGmom0FybqafG33xhwqkBb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>第三部分：生长环境不同的人类好好区分</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a> 希尔真从高中毕业就</span><strong><span>不再穿内衣</span></strong><span>，啊，好敢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a> 面对凝视直接大声问：</span><strong><span>请问你是在看我的胸部吗！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3850">1:04:10</a>你所</span><strong><span>向往</span></strong><span>的，是别人的</span><strong><span>日常</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3910">1:05:10</a> 出门在外，区分哪国人小妙招</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4110">1:08:30</a> 过马路也要和陌生人</span><strong><span>say hi</span></strong></p><span></span><h3><br></h3><span></span><h3><span>「 节目中使用的音乐 」</span></h3><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=5057904" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=5057904"><span>San Francisco (Be Sure To Wear Flowers In Your Hair)-Scott McKenzie</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=4370918" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=4370918"><span>Rhythm Of The Rain-The Cascades</span></a></p><span></span><h3><br></h3><span></span><h3><span>「 推荐作品 」</span></h3><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gV4y1v7Hb/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=4791ae7d965fbeb8364a6a09eb716fc4" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gV4y1v7Hb/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=4791ae7d965fbeb8364a6a09eb716fc4"><span>📺 b站up主——@司徒小韩环球旅行</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/431596518" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/431596518"><span>📺 b站up主——@恩妈的生活记录</span></a></p><span></span><h3><br></h3><span></span><h3><span>「 staff 」</span></h3><span></span><p><span>🌟 本期主播｜@希尔真：base深圳，b站up主，打工养猫人。@铲铲chan：武汉，ui/视觉设计师，自由职业中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟 声音设计｜@铲铲chan</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟 封面设计｜@铲铲chan</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「 合作 」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信:Cactuschan_</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱:lovechanfree@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢uu萌的收听，我们会不定期更新节目～欢迎大家来评论区多多互动，别忘记订阅我们的播客哦～❤️</span></p>]]></description>
